{"ref":"BDB, זְנוּנִים","hw":"זְנוּנִים","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">זְנוּנִים</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>fornication</strong>, pl.abstr. <em>intens.</em> <strong>(</strong>Ol<sup>§ 215 a</sup>; Dl<sup>Pr 74</sup>, der. from √ <span dir=\"rtl\">זנן</span>, Assyrian <em>zanânu</em>, <em>fill full</em>, cf. Dl<sup>ib. 73</sup><strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">ז׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 1:2\" href=\"/Hosea.1.2\">Ho 1:2</a> + 5 times, cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">זְנוּנֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Nahum 3:4\" href=\"/Nahum.3.4\">Na 3:4</a> + 2 times, <span dir=\"rtl\">זְנוּנַיִךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:29\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.29\">Ez 23:29</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">זְנוּנֶיהָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 2:4\" href=\"/Hosea.2.4\">Ho 2:4</a> <a data-ref=\"Nahum 3:4\" href=\"/Nahum.3.4\">Na 3:4</a>.<br><strong>a.</strong>  sexual <a data-ref=\"Genesis 38:24\" href=\"/Genesis.38.24\">Gn 38:24</a> (J) <a data-ref=\"Hosea 1:2\" href=\"/Hosea.1.2\">Ho 1:2</a><sup>(×2)</sup>.<br><strong>b.</strong>  international <a data-ref=\"Nahum 3:4\" href=\"/Nahum.3.4\">Na 3:4</a><sup>(×2)</sup>.<br><strong>c.</strong>  religious <a data-ref=\"II Kings 9:22\" href=\"/II_Kings.9.22\">2 K 9:22</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.11\">Ez 23:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:29\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.29\">29</a> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 2:4\" href=\"/Hosea.2.4\">Ho 2:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Hosea 2:6\" href=\"/Hosea.2.6\">6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Hosea 4:12\" href=\"/Hosea.4.12\">4:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Hosea 5:4\" href=\"/Hosea.5.4\">5:4</a>.","next":"BDB, זְנוּת","prev":"BDB, זָנָה"}